Title:          tint2.tcz
Description:    TESTING lightweight panel / taskbar for X11 WMs
Version:        17.0.2
Author:         tint2 authors (o9000 / Thierry Lorthiois et al.)
Original-site:  https://gitlab.com/o9000/tint2
Copying-policy: GPL-2.0
Size:           404K
Extension_by:   Zendrael
Tags:           panel taskbar tint2 openbox x11 corepure64
Comments:       compiled from source for CorePure64
                ----------
                tint2 is a simple panel/taskbar for window managers
                such as openbox (also works with others). Includes
                tint2conf (GTK theme configurator).
                ----------
                Optional:
                tint2-doc.tcz    — man page + docs
                tint2-locale.tcz — tint2conf translations
                ----------
                Requires: CorePure64 (x86_64).
                ----------
                Load:
                $ tce-load -i tint2.tcz
                ----------
                Run (from an X session):
                $ tint2 &
                Configure:
                $ tint2conf
                ----------
                Default config: /usr/local/etc/xdg/tint2/tint2rc
                User config: ~/.config/tint2/tint2rc
                ----------
                This extension contains:
                tint2-17.0.2 - GPL-2.0 -
                https://gitlab.com/o9000/tint2/-/archive/17.0.2/tint2-17.0.2.tar.bz2
